tip: | Compare it with the car. | The same wheels, glass and lamps, but one tall box instead of two. Change the proportions and the plan still holds.
tip: 1 | One tall box. | A van is a little shorter than you expect and much higher than the car. Nothing else about the block-in is new.
tip: 3 | White is not white. | The lightest step is the top only. The lit side is a step down and the shaded side two, or the form disappears.
tip: 4 | A stripe wraps the corner. | It runs down the side at one height and carries on across the front, a step darker there, which ties the two faces together.
